---
modified: "2026-10-04"
title: "Downsizing & Later-Life Moving Advice UK | Chayce Blog"
description: "Practical UK guides on downsizing, moving an elderly parent, retirement villages, moving costs and settling in, from the Chayce team in Northampton."
bodyClass: "page-template page-loaded"
homeNav: false
navGlassy: false
layout: base.njk
permalink: "/blog/"
tags: []
eleventyExcludeFromCollections: true
policyFaq:
  - q: "What can I read on the Chayce blog?"
    a: "Practical UK guides on downsizing, moving an elderly parent, retirement villages, removals costs, care homes, packing and settling in."
  - q: "How do I find a guide on a specific topic?"
    a: "Browse the guides page, where every post is grouped by topic."
  - q: "Are the guides legal or financial advice?"
    a: "No. They are general information. For legal, tax or funding questions, speak to a solicitor or an independent adviser."
  - q: "Can Chayce help me with my own move?"
    a: "Yes. Call 07708 925432 or book a one-hour Discovery Consultation for £150."
headExtra: |
  <link rel="stylesheet" href="/css/chayce-nav.css?v={{ build.version }}">
  <link rel="stylesheet" href="/css/chayce-blog.css?v={{ build.version }}">
---
{# Real /blog/ listing — separate from /news/, which stays exactly as it is
   today (3 static teasers, no real post pages). Same page-hero + news-card
   visual language as /news/ (src/css/chayce-blog.css), but this one is
   data-driven from collections.blog, so every card here is a real page. #}
<script type="application/ld+json">
{"@type":"BreadcrumbList","@context":"https://schema.org","itemListElement":[{"item":"https://chayceproperties.com/","name":"Home","@type":"ListItem","position":1},{"item":"https://chayceproperties.com/blog/","name":"Blog","@type":"ListItem","position":2}]}
</script>
{% if collections.blog.length > 0 %}
{# CollectionPage + ItemList generated from the same collection that renders the cards below, so the markup can never list a post the page doesn't show. #}
<script type="application/ld+json">
{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"CollectionPage","name":{{ title | dump | safe }},"description":{{ description | dump | safe }},"url":"https://chayceproperties.com/blog/","mainEntity":{"@type":"ItemList","itemListElement":[{% for post in collections.blog | reverse %}{"@type":"ListItem","position":{{ loop.index }},"url":"https://chayceproperties.com{{ post.url }}","name":{{ post.data.title | dump | safe }}}{% if not loop.last %},{% endif %}{% endfor %}]}}
</script>
{% endif %}
<div class="page-hero" style="background-image:url({% imageUrl "chayce-blog-hero.webp" %});{% imageSet "chayce-blog-hero.webp" %};background-size:cover;background-position:center;">
  <div class="container">
    <p class="breadcrumb"><a href="/">Home</a> / <em>Blog</em></p>
    <h1>Elderly Removals &amp; Downsizing <em>Guides</em></h1>
    <p style="color:#ccc;margin-top:10px;font-size:16px;">Guides on elderly removals, downsizing and later-life moving from Chayce Properties</p>
  </div>
</div>

<section class="page-section">
  <div class="container">
    <h2 style="font-family:'Playfair Display',serif;color:var(--navy);font-size:28px;margin:0 0 28px">What can you read on the Chayce blog?</h2>
    {% if collections.blog.length > 0 %}
    <div class="row">
      {% for post in collections.blog | reverse %}
      <div class="col-md-4">
        <div class="news-card" style="margin-bottom:40px">
          {% if post.data.featuredImage %}
          <figure><img src="{{ post.data.featuredImage }}" alt="{{ post.data.featuredImageAlt | default(post.data.title) }}" width="940" height="650"></figure>
          {% endif %}
          <span>{{ post.date | readableDate }}</span>
          <h5><a href="{{ post.url }}">{{ post.data.title }}</a></h5>
          {% if post.data.description %}<p>{{ post.data.description }}</p>{% endif %}
          <a href="{{ post.url }}" style="color:#c8a96e;font-size:13px;letter-spacing:1px;text-transform:uppercase;text-decoration:none">Read More &rsaquo;</a>
        </div>
      </div>
      {% endfor %}
    </div>
    {% else %}
    <p style="color:#666;text-align:center;">New posts are coming soon.</p>
    {% endif %}
  </div>
</section>

<section class="page-section blog-guides-link" style="padding-top:0">
  <div class="container">
    <div class="guides-cta">
      <div>
        <h2>Looking for a specific topic?</h2>
        <p>Browse every guide grouped by what you are trying to sort out: downsizing, costs, moving a parent, care homes, packing and settling in.</p>
      </div>
      <a href="/guides/" class="guides-cta-btn">Browse guides by topic &rarr;</a>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<section class="page-section" style="padding-top:0">
  <div class="container legal-body" style="max-width:820px">
{% include "policy-faq.njk" %}
  </div>
</section>

